<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four stocks fell, two rose and three were flat in 3.1-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The remaining 12 stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell in a 19.1-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>Agros, Kety, Mostostal Export, Polifarb Cieszyn, Wedel and Zywiec were listed for the first time in live trade.</p>
